<title>UK: ING Bank sets 200 billion lire two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>ING Bank sets 200 billion lire two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead manager IMI Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK NV AMSTRERDAM</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -15 BP    PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA2	 ISS PRICE  100.2905  FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/AMST  DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC   0.20</p>
<p> NOTES     *US/UK/ITALY/NETHERLANDS</p>
<p>		ISSUEED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
